ate": [1766, 1499, 2280, 1547], "order": 24, "polygon_points": [[1766.0, 1499.0], [2280.0, 1499.0], [2280.0, 1547.0], [1766.0, 1547.0]]}, {"cls_id": 9, "label": "footer_image", "score": 0.8475098013877869, "coordinate": [2137, 1650, 2529, 1860], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[2137.0, 1650.0], [2529.0, 1650.0], [2529.0, 1860.0], [2137.0, 1860.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.6180332899093628, "coordinate": [2682, 1908, 2723, 1940], "order": 25, "polygon_points": [[2682.0, 1908.0], [2722.0, 1908.0], [2722.0, 1939.0], [2682.0, 1939.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 第三章 我们的理念\n\n公平 自由 快乐 博爱\n\n## DÍ 胖东来\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_493_638_634_784.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n公平 自由 快乐 博爱\n\nFAIRNESS FREEDOM HAPPINESS LOVE\n\n企业文化信仰\n\n公平、自由、快乐、博爱\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_494_858_634_1004.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n企业精神\n\n乐观、正义、勇敢、节制、感恩、舍得\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_495_1045_635_1192.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n企业警示\n\n嫉妒、自私、贪婪、虚伪、自卑\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_496_1264_634_1410.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"4%\" /></div>\n\n\n企业目标\n\n优秀的细节管理\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_494_1491_631_1635.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"4%\" /></div>\n\n\n我们的团队\n\n乐观的、健康的、专业的\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1568_693_1711_847.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 我们的使命\n\n顾客满意\n\n丰富的商品、合理的价格\n\n温馨的环境、完善的服务\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1568_983_1712_1137.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 我们的准则\n\n你心我心，将心比心\n\n遇事抱吃亏态度\n\n不是自己的坚决不要\n\n不要急功近利\n\n要从一点一滴的小事做起\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1569_1418_1712_1561.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 我们的愿景\n\n创造财富，播撒文明，分享快乐", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_493_638_634_784.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//27286b16-cd74-4ca5-b461-d92ab448a7a7/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_493_638_634_784.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A09%3A50Z%2F-1%2F%2F9f74a7e132f2d87a2a741c7ea5e4dc348e18e283907dd908070d5e701b3f89fc", "imgs/img_in_image_box_494_858_634_1004.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//27286b16-cd74-4ca5-b461-d92ab448a7a7/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_494_858_634_1004.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A09%3A50Z%2F-1%2F%2F4d8fada8438e1574bc0e38144d0b93676b30a83647b77ed458c258e5853f5ca5", "imgs/img_in_image_box_495_1045_635_1192.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//27286b16-cd74-4ca5-b461-d92ab448a7a7/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_495_1045_635_1192.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A09%3A50Z%2F-1%2F%2Fb3277cbc6e5867fb17f2405648709197215059a170b9e34c55eec4199b648ce2", "imgs/img_in_image_box_496_1264_634_1410.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//27286b16-cd74-4ca5-b461-d92ab448a7a7/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_496_1264_634_1410.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A09%3A51Z%2F-1%2F%2F5ef1ca0542afcd4df17e0e013a15cdf6c9be20962b36d8fe640cfee9523bd3e2", "imgs/img_in_image_box_494_1491_631_1635.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//27286b16-cd74-4ca5-b461-d92ab448a7a7/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_494_1491_631_1635.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A09%3A51Z%2F-1%2F%2Faf9e302ac372ea0978a6b849265538a40bb9bd258c1d12f4b041762aadaba271", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1568_693_1711_847.jpg": "https://pp